{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"523ec161e6e2fbe2d4e0c7d06c52d3b8fbd47221360777bba040e99b0235e6ef","ja":"私、みんなと山の上で食べられたらって思って、\nマフィンをたくさん作ってきたんです♪","zh":"我想着要是能在山顶和大家一起吃就好了，\n所以做了好多玛芬蛋糕呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"349fde083eace8a99accaa8e22a064ee102c600e90d0d7fbc87cf35a9dd28787","ja":"これをスタッフさんに食べてもらったら……\nって、あれぇ～～っ！？","zh":"要是把这个拿给工作人员吃的话……\n哎，咦～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f04b2e19d1d40007fec5ad3708f35f092b60b648a742e432df719e578165b2d8","ja":"なんと……まふぃんがすべて\nしぇいくされてしまっていますね……。","zh":"天哪……玛芬蛋糕全都\n被摇晃碎掉了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"bcd5232423c91f744455b16183b2b432a0d8c91ca92ef26551c4221cb4e07446","ja":"全部ひっくり返っちゃってるし、\nデコレーションも崩れちゃってるね……。","zh":"全翻掉了，\n装饰也都塌掉了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7253e78da197056e8936f9db91a1b109cb093eb313e2ca7c07145292c29ea351","ja":"春香、アンタ袋を思いっきり\n振り回しでもしたの？","zh":"春香，你难不成把袋子\n用力到处乱甩了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"947981b42425a7a22c3d771de39ff7ac8276a431a84ec9345867e09dff2befa9","ja":"そんなことしないよ～！　今までずっと\nカバンの中にしまってたんだし……。","zh":"才不会做那种事呢～！毕竟之前一直\n都收在包包里……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"3665722b44b5a6c45e1ce572bb50bd65c7e04e3a0d67a8de7ef2d745de56a2ad","ja":"あっ！　そういえば、\n途中で転んじゃったんだった……！","zh":"啊！　话说回来，\n中途摔了一跤来着……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"828a99cab637a244e42754b6e1ad08cbbafcdb3d137087716c530961e97261fa","ja":"なるほど。では恐らく、\nその時にかばんが振られてしまったのかと。","zh":"原来如此。那么恐怕是在那个时候，\n包被甩动了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b25321464bc67260d4778f652c210863eaf25215e9348b494117c92dadfc5d2e","ja":"ですよね……うう、やっちゃった～……。","zh":"也是呢……呜呜，搞砸了～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"74bdc67184738137d9ae2320e52a4f468f361b379755ab48c074bd28bb037dbf","ja":"だ、大丈夫だよ、春香ちゃん。\n味は変わらないと思うし……！","zh":"没、没事的，春香。\n味道应该不会变……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"d0fe666f3c0b005e1fcf2f317032aed83d0ad4bad9a34224afa2f74233cc1a21","ja":"そうそう。むしろこれくらいの見た目の方が、\nみんなの毒気を抜くのに、ちょうどいいわ！","zh":"没错没错。倒不如说这种长相，\n正好能打消大家的戒心呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1497.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8059548a4e53602a714d5b219a8ecb85b2592ff29fe1da2399d0ed3aa044c464","ja":"みなさーん！　春香からお菓子の差し入れですよ～♪\nいったん休憩にして、みんなでお茶にしませんか～？","zh":"大家——！春香给大家送点心来啦～♪\n要不要先休息一下，一起喝个茶呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
